{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T15:55:28+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-23T15:55:28+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Brenntag SE","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Specialty Chemicals","country":"Germany","city":"Essen","website":"https://www.brenntag.com","employees":16942,"summary":"Brenntag SE distributes chemicals and ingredients in Germany, the United States, the United Kingdom, China, Canada, Italy, Poland, France, and internationally. The company operates in two segments, Brenntag Essentials and Brenntag Specialties. It provides just-in-time delivery, product mixing, blending, repackaging, inventory management, and drum return handling, as well as application, marketing and supply chain solutions, technical and formulation support, comprehensive regulatory know-how, and digital solutions, such as digital sales channels and product platforms. The company serves customers in various industries, including nutrition, pharma, beauty and care, and water treatment; and industrial markets, as well as coatings, adhesives, sealants and elastomers, and constructions, polymers, and rubber industries. The company was founded in 1874 and is headquartered in Essen, Germany.","exchange":"XETRA","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Brenntag SE distribue des produits chimiques et des ingrédients en Allemagne, aux États-Unis, au Royaume-Uni, en Chine, au Canada, en Italie, en Pologne, en France et à l'international. La société opère dans deux segments, Brenntag Essentials et Brenntag Specialties. Il fournit la livraison juste à temps, le mélange de produits, le mélange, le reconditionnement, la gestion des stocks et la manutention des retours de fûts, ainsi que des solutions d'application, de marketing et de chaîne d'approvisionnement, un support technique et de formulation, un savoir-faire réglementaire complet et des solutions numériques, te